     "data ownership",
     "bounded[- ]context",
     "which tables does"
    ]
   },
   "inputs": [],
   "outputs": [
    "findings"
   ],
   "summary": "Audit a single service for the database TABLES it touches — via raw SQL, ORM models/queries, and shared-model imports — then classify each as owned vs foreign …"
